Bakanl&#305;k bütçesinden kar&#351;&#305;lanmas&#305;na yönelik
çal&#305;&#351;malara,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Okullarda
s&#305;n&#305;flardaki ö&#287;renci say&#305;lar&#305;n&#305;n pedagojik
standartlar gözetilerek düzenlenmesi ve ikili e&#287;itime son verilmesine,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Ta&#351;&#305;mal&#305;
e&#287;itime son verilmesi talebine,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>&#304;li&#351;kin
sorular&#305; ve Milli E&#287;itim Bakan&#305; Mahmut Özer’in cevab&#305;
(7/55499), (7/55508), (7/55518), (7/55520), (7/55527)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
