mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>DURMU&#350; YILMAZ (Devamla) –
Da&#287;&#305;t&#305;m adil de de&#287;il. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>&#304;Y&#304; Parti iktidar&#305;nda f&#305;rsat
